# model-ucla-roms: the recipe that fetches, builds and runs ucla-roms on a sandbox.
# Read by exportit/tools/export.py; described in exportit/MAP.md.
#
# One unit per model (stage 5, decision 1). The model's directory goes to the
# root of the unit, unchanged; files shared by several models are in model-common.

covers models/ucla-roms/
copy models/ucla-roms/    ./

# Files that exist only in the unit.
new UNIT.md        # what this unit is, where it came from, how it is checked
new LICENSE      # a copy of the repository's LICENSE
new Justfile
new tests/
new .gitignore   # the unit's own, since it is a repository of its own (MOVINGDAY.md)
new .specify/     # Spec Kit 1.2.3 and the constitution (MOVINGDAY.md, M4)
new .claude/      # Spec Kit's skills
new CLAUDE.md     # written by `just constitution`

# Its originals were deleted from Cloud-Sandbox by stage 22, step 3 (2026-11-19):
# the unit owns its copied files, and only its lineage is checked.
owned
